   "status": "answered",
   "answer": "[Source S1] suggests categorizing generative AI risks into governance, content provenance, pre-deployment testing, and incident disclosure.\n\n[Source S2] also mentions that the profile was developed per Section 4.1(a)(i)(A) of EO 14110, directing the Secretary of Commerce to develop a companion resource for generative AI.\n\n[Source S3] discusses performance across demographic groups and subgroups, addressing quality of service and allocation of services and resources. It also quantifies harms using various methods like field testing with sub-group populations and applying general fairness metrics.",
